  "title": "Oatmeal Chocolate Chip Muffins",
  "description": "These oatmeal chocolate chip muffins make for a hearty, delicious on-the-go breakfast with chocolate chips and pecans in every bite!",
  "authors": [
    "Kari Farwell"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-05-09T08:36:15-04:00",
